# PAPP phrasebook source (lane T5-S, 2026-11-07). Format: cat | es | en | zh | pinyin(optional)
# Empty pinyin = generated with pypinyin (tone marks, tone sandhi on). The first 40 rows are the
# Tab5 built-in PHRASES (client/tab5/main/content.h) verbatim, so their SD cache keys match.
# Chinese written by the lane; 🔎 review by a native speaker before 17 Nov is recommended.
